# CFI Ticketing Tracker

A cloud-ready ticket management system with a CFI-inspired visual identity and support-workflow foundation.

## Stack
- Next.js 14
- TypeScript
- Prisma ORM
- SQLite for local development
- CFI navy + gold styling

## Local setup

```bash
npm install
npx prisma generate
npx prisma db push
npx prisma db seed
npm run dev
```

Then open http://localhost:3000

## Project status
This repository contains the initial working foundation for the ticketing system, including:
- CFI-themed dashboard
- ticket overview and detail pages
- Prisma schema and seed data
- CRUD API routes for tickets and comments
- role-based mock UI flow

## Future enhancements
- Manager form builder
- CSV import for historical tickets
- report exports and filtering
- advanced permissions and audit history
- deployment setup for cloud hosting
